'''Spinners''' (風車, ''Kazaguruma'', '''Windmill''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

